WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Start with every pot in the experiment.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Clear the chart to build a focused comparison.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Select Pot 62. Its individual trace appears.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Add Pot 64 to compare two control pots.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Add a drought pot. Each line stays independent.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Keep the control and drought traces side by side.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Open Pot 62 to inspect its readings and hardware identity.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Step through timestamps with the keyboard.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Review raw values, calibration and recorded valve openings.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Return to the same two-pot comparison.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Restore all traces and keep exploring.
